{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（丁未、前一三四）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（丁未、前一三四）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f66f4fd-db0e-11ef-ba70-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f66f500-db0e-11ef-aeb7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：孝，謂善事父母者；廉，謂清廉有廉隅者也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：孝，谓善事父母者；廉，谓清廉有廉隅者也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8f66f4ff-db0e-11ef-a23a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"董仲舒，广川（今河北省景县）人，西汉时官员与学者，活跃于汉景帝至汉武帝时期，曾任《春秋》博士、江都国相、胶西国相。董仲舒向汉武帝呈上《天人三策》，提出儒家的治国蓝图，晚年闭门研究与著作，甚受朝廷重视，所作文章后世编为《春秋繁露》。董仲舒在儒学史上地位崇高，被视为汉代第一大儒，他建议罢黜百家，独尊儒术，促进汉代以至后世儒学的兴盛及主流化。然而董仲舒抑黜百家的主张，亦被今人批评为阻碍中国学术思想的发展。董仲舒以思想著称，主要分成几个方面：在宇宙论方面，董仲舒相信天是至高无上的人格神与万物之本，主宰自然；他提倡天人相应，天之道与人之道一致而相通，天是人伦道德与价值根源，儒家哲学本体。董仲舒是阴阳五行说的集大成者，最早提出五行相生说，认为阴阳二气充盈天地，推动四季变化。董仲舒给予儒家思想与价值观以宇宙论及形上基础。在政治方面，提出天人感应论，劝告君主施政须合乎天道，推行仁政与德治，以礼乐教化移风易俗，反对法家以刑罚治国，主张“德主刑辅”，并申张灾异与祥瑞之说，在精神上制约君权。在伦理道德方面，董仲舒提倡三纲五常与忠君之道，人性有先天的仁义与贪欲，必须接受君王圣人的教化。他提出三统循环的历史哲学论，三朝为一周期。除了思想之外，经学方面，董仲舒以研究《春秋》闻名，教授春秋公羊学，着重发挥孔子的微言大义。宗教方面，董仲舒最重视天子祭天的郊祀。文学方面，撰有《士不遇赋》。","link_td_id":"Q10008076","link_td_number_id":87933,"people_name":"董仲舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"董仲舒","people_xingming":"董仲舒","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8f66f501-db0e-11ef-a3db-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"1冬，十一月，初令郡國舉孝廉各一人，從董仲舒之言也。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十一月，武帝首次下令各郡国各举孝廉一人，这是采纳董仲舒的建议。","content_jianti_auto":"1冬，十一月，初令郡国举孝廉各一人，从董仲舒之言也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1423,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f66f4fe-db0e-11ef-9e97-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8f66f504-db0e-11ef-a27c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"洪氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"洪氏","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"8f66f505-db0e-11ef-a65b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8f66f506-db0e-11ef-a0e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8f66f507-db0e-11ef-b171-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"盤洲","place_name_jianti_auto":"盘洲","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8f66f508-db0e-11ef-ba61-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"西汉","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8f66f509-db0e-11ef-89f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"周末置左、右、前、後將軍，秦、漢因之，位上卿。至武帝置驍騎、車騎等將軍，後來名號浸多，不可勝紀，謂之雜號將軍。盤洲洪氏曰：西漢雜號將軍掌征伐背叛，事訖則罷，不常置也。驍，堅堯翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"周末置左、右、前、后将军，秦、汉因之，位上卿。至武帝置骁骑、车骑等将军，后来名号浸多，不可胜纪，谓之杂号将军。盘洲洪氏曰：西汉杂号将军掌征伐背叛，事讫则罢，不常置也。骁，坚尧翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8f66f503-db0e-11ef-ad97-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"程","people_name_jianti_auto":"程","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f66f50b-db0e-11ef-a6d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"顓頊","people_name_jianti_auto":"颛顼","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8f66f50c-db0e-11ef-bc48-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"重黎","people_name_jianti_auto":"重黎","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8f66f50d-db0e-11ef-acc3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周宣王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周宣王","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8f66f50e-db0e-11ef-87a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"程伯休父","people_name_jianti_auto":"程伯休父","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8f66f50f-db0e-11ef-a175-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"司馬氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"司马氏","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8f66f510-db0e-11ef-954c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"程","place_name_jianti_auto":"程","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8f66f511-db0e-11ef-9979-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姓譜：程本自顓頊重黎之後，周宣王時，程伯休父入爲大司馬，封於程者以爲氏；與司馬氏同出。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姓谱：程本自颛顼重黎之后，周宣王时，程伯休父入为大司马，封于程者以为氏；与司马氏同出。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8f66f50a-db0e-11ef-838f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"部者，軍行各有分部；伍者，五人爲伍也。部有校尉，伍有伍長。行，戶剛翻。陳，讀曰陣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"部者，军行各有分部；伍者，五人为伍也。部有校尉，伍有伍长。行，户刚翻。陈，读曰阵。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8f66f513-db0e-11ef-9373-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孟康","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟康","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f66f515-db0e-11ef-a680-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蘇林","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏林","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8f66f516-db0e-11ef-9992-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荀悅","people_name_jianti_auto":"荀悦","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8f66f517-db0e-11ef-a79b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"8f66f518-db0e-11ef-8ae6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"孟康曰：刁斗，以銅作鐎，受一斗，晝炊飲食，夜擊持行夜，名曰刁斗。蘇林曰：形如鋗，無緣。荀悅曰：刁斗，小鈴，如宮中傳夜鈴也。索隱曰：鋗，卽鈴也。埤蒼云：鐎，溫器，有柄；斗，似銚，無緣。師古曰：鐎，音譙。鋗，火玄翻；鋗，卽銚也。銚，音姚。緣，去聲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"孟康曰：刁斗，以铜作𨱓，受一斗，昼炊饮食，夜击持行夜，名曰刁斗。苏林曰：形如𫓶，无缘。荀悦曰：刁斗，小铃，如宫中传夜铃也。索隐曰：𫓶，即铃也。埤苍云：𨱓，温器，有柄；斗，似铫，无缘。师古曰：𨱓，音谯。𫓶，火玄翻；𫓶，即铫也。铫，音姚。缘，去声。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"8f66f514-db0e-11ef-8181-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"淮南子曰：斥，度也；候，視也，望也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"淮南子曰：斥，度也；候，视也，望也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"8f66f51b-db0e-11ef-a167-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f66f51e-db0e-11ef-8551-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：簿，文簿。治，直之翻；下言治同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：簿，文簿。治，直之翻；下言治同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"8f66f51d-db0e-11ef-8835-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"樂，音洛；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"乐，音洛；下同。","note_type